# Swan Compiler 2 — SVM Optimization
#
# Optimize verified SVM before target-specific instruction selection.
#
# Required optimization families:
# - Sparse conditional constant propagation.
# - Dead instruction and dead block elimination.
# - Common subexpression elimination.
# - Algebraic simplification and strength reduction.
# - Copy propagation and virtual-register coalescing preparation.
# - Loop-invariant code motion where dominance and effects are proven.
# - Control-flow simplification and branch folding.
# - Memory-operation forwarding only with valid alias/effect information.
#
# Every pass must preserve traps, side effects, volatile/atomic semantics,
# ownership effects, and observable ordering. Verify after each pass.
#
# Implementation status: contract; the current ConstantFold.swan is a narrow
# i32 add/subtract/multiply pass, not this complete optimization pipeline.
